{"scene_id": "pt_enemy_32", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_enemy_32.fountain", "heading": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "STOCKMANN", "names": ["STOCKMANN"], "gender": "?", "first": 1, "spoke": 0}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Quite so.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "And so is public opinion.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "And you, Mr. Aslaksen\u2014I suppose you will be answerable for the Householders' Association?", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, and for the Temperance Society.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "You may rely on that.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "But, gentlemen\u2014I really am ashamed to ask the question\u2014but, what return do you\u2014?", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "We should prefer to help you without any return whatever, believe me.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "But the \"People's Messenger\" is in rather a shaky condition; it doesn't go really well; and I should be very unwilling to suspend the paper now, when there is so much work to do here in the political way.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Quite so; that would be a great trial to such a friend of the people as you are.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "(Flares up.)", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "But I am an enemy of the people, remember!", "para": 4, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "(Walks about the room.)", "para": 4, "sent": 4, "present": [0]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Where have I put my stick?", "para": 4, "sent": 5, "present": [0]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Where the devil is my stick?", "para": 4, "sent": 6, "present": [0]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "What's that?", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Surely you never mean\u2014", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (standing still.)", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "And suppose I don't give you a single penny of all I get out of it?", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "Money is not very easy to get out of us rich folk, please to remember!", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "And you please to remember that this affair of the shares can be represented in two ways!", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, and you are just the man to do it.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "If I don't come to the rescue of the \"People's Messenger,\" you will certainly take an evil view of the affair; you will hunt me down, I can well imagine\u2014pursue me\u2014try to throttle me as a dog does a hare.", "para": 9, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "It is a natural law; every animal must fight for its own livelihood.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "And get its food where it can, you know.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (walking about the room).", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "Then you go and look for yours in the gutter; because I am going to show you which is the strongest animal of us three!", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "(Finds an umbrella and brandishes it above his head.)", "para": 12, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Ah, now\u2014!", "para": 12, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "You are surely not going to use violence!", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "Take care what you are doing with that umbrella.", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "Out of the window with you, Mr. Hovstad!", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad (edging to the door).", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "Are you quite mad!", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "Out of the window, Mr. Aslaksen!", "para": 17, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "Jump, I tell you!", "para": 17, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "You will have to do it, sooner or later.", "para": 17, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen (running round the writing-table).", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "Moderation, Doctor\u2014I am a delicate man\u2014I can stand so little\u2014(calls out) help, help!", "para": 18, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "(MRS. STOCKMANN, PETRA and HORSTER come in from the sitting-room.)", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "Good gracious, Thomas!", "para": 20, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "What is happening?", "para": 20, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (brandishing the umbrella).", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "Jump out, I tell you!", "para": 21, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Out into the gutter!", "para": 21, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "An assault on an unoffending man!", "para": 22, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "I call you to witness, Captain Horster.", "para": 22, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "(Hurries out through the hall.)", "para": 22, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen (irresolutely).", "para": 23, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "If only I knew the way about here\u2014.", "para": 23, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "(Steals out through the sitting-room.)", "para": 23, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann (holding her husband back).", "para": 24, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "Control yourself, Thomas!", "para": 24, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (throwing down the umbrella).", "para": 25, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "Upon my soul, they have escaped after all.", "para": 25, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 26, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "What did they want you to do?", "para": 26, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 27, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "I will tell you later on; I have something else to think about now.", "para": 27, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "(Goes to the table and writes something on a calling-card.)", "para": 27, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "Look there, Katherine; what is written there?", "para": 27, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 28, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "Three big Noes; what does that mean.", "para": 28, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 29, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 81, "kind": "action", "text": "I will tell you that too, later on.", "para": 29, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "(Holds out the card to PETRA.)", "para": 29, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "There, Petra; tell sooty-face to run over to the \"Badger's\" with that, as quick as she can.", "para": 29, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "Hurry up!", "para": 29, "sent": 4, "present": [0]}, {"u": 85, "kind": "action", "text": "(PETRA takes the card and goes out to the hall.)", "para": 29, "sent": 5, "present": [0]}, {"u": 86, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 30, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 87, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, I think I have had a visit from every one of the devil's messengers to-day!", "para": 30, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 88, "kind": "action", "text": "But now I am going to sharpen my pen till they can feel its point; I shall dip it in venom and gall; I shall hurl my inkpot at their heads!", "para": 30, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 89, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 31, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 90, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, but we are going away, you know, Thomas.", "para": 31, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 91, "kind": "action", "text": "(PETRA comes back.)", "para": 32, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 92, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 33, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 93, "kind": "action", "text": "Well?", "para": 33, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 94, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 34, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 95, "kind": "action", "text": "She has gone with it.", "para": 34, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 96, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 35, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 97, "kind": "action", "text": "Good.\u2014Going away, did you say?", "para": 35, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 98, "kind": "action", "text": "No, I'll be hanged if we are going away!", "para": 35, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 99, "kind": "action", "text": "We are going to stay where we are, Katherine!", "para": 35, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 100, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 36, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 101, "kind": "action", "text": "Stay here?", "para": 36, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 102, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 37, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 103, "kind": "action", "text": "Here, in the town?", "para": 37, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 104, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 38, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 105, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, here.", "para": 38, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 106, "kind": "action", "text": "This is the field of battle\u2014this is where the fight will be.", "para": 38, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 107, "kind": "action", "text": "This is where I shall triumph!", "para": 38, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 108, "kind": "action", "text": "As soon as I have had my trousers sewn up I shall go out and look for another house.", "para": 38, "sent": 4, "present": [0]}, {"u": 109, "kind": "action", "text": "We must have a roof over our heads for the winter.", "para": 38, "sent": 5, "present": [0]}, {"u": 110, "kind": "action", "text": "Horster.", "para": 39, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 111, "kind": "action", "text": "That you shall have in my house.", "para": 39, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 112, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 40, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 113, "kind": "action", "text": "Can I?", "para": 40, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 114, "kind": "action", "text": "Horsier.", "para": 41, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 115, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, quite well.", "para": 41, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 116, "kind": "action", "text": "I have plenty of room, and I am almost never at home.", "para": 41, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 117, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 42, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 118, "kind": "action", "text": "How good of you, Captain Horster!", "para": 42, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 119, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 43, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 120, "kind": "action", "text": "Thank you!", "para": 43, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 121, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (grasping his hand).", "para": 44, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 122, "kind": "action", "text": "Thank you, thank you!", "para": 44, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 123, "kind": "action", "text": "That is one trouble over!", "para": 44, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 124, "kind": "action", "text": "Now I can set to work in earnest at once.", "para": 44, "sent": 3, "present": [0]}, {"u": 125, "kind": "action", "text": "There is an endless amount of things to look through here, Katherine!", "para": 44, "sent": 4, "present": [0]}, {"u": 126, "kind": "action", "text": "Luckily I shall have all my time at my disposal; because I have been dismissed from the Baths, you know.", "para": 44, "sent": 5, "present": [0]}]}